LIGHT DRIVE

Original game rules, indexed pixel artwork, sparse soundscape and
driving feedback created for this project. Game code is MIT licensed.

Rumble PWM driver reused from the Pinball game, for CHGame Rev0
GPIO1 / PC0 / H1.8, TIM2 CH4.

Build dependency: CHGame, copyright 2026 Kevin Bates (bateske), Apache 2.0;
CHGfx, copyright 2026 bateske, MIT; CHGame board runtime, MIT.
Dependency license notices are included under licenses/.

Visual inspiration: Kravennart's "Night drive, 4 colors", supplied by the
user. Reference artwork is not copied or included in the game assets.
